      "zh": {
        "title": "中共18機艦船台海周邊活動 國軍嚴密監控",
        "summary": "國防部偵獲中共機艦船18艘架次活動；國軍派機艦與飛彈系統監控應處。",
        "body": [
          "中華民國國防部表示，自2026年8月21日上午6時至8月22日上午6時止，國軍共偵獲中共軍機3架次、軍艦8艘次及公務船7艘次，總計18艘（架）機艦船持續在台灣海峽周邊空域與海域活動。",
          "根據國防部公布的示意圖資料，國軍於21日下午4時50分至晚間6時45分期間，在台灣海峽空域偵獲中共2架次主戰機逾越海峽中線，進入北部及西南空域。此外，國軍於21日下午3時30分至下午5時50分，在台灣防空識別區（ADIZ）內的台灣北部空域偵獲中共1架直升機。",
          "對此，國防部強調，國軍已即時運用任務機、艦艇以及岸置飛彈系統，對台海周邊相關動態進行嚴密監控與應處。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "Taiwan Tracks 18 Chinese Military Aircraft and Vessels Around Strait",
        "summary": "Taiwan's Defense Ministry tracked 18 Chinese military aircraft and vessels operating around the Taiwan Strait.",
        "body": [
          "Taiwan's Ministry of National Defense announced that 18 Chinese military aircraft and vessels were detected operating around the Taiwan Strait between 06:00 on August 21 and 06:00 on August 22, 2026. The tracked total included three aircraft, eight naval vessels, and seven official ships.",
          "According to the defense ministry's activity map, two Chinese main battle aircraft crossed the Taiwan Strait median line into northern and southwestern airspace between 16:50 and 18:45 on August 21. Additionally, one Chinese military helicopter was detected operating in Taiwan's northern air defense identification zone between 15:30 and 17:50 on the same day.",
          "In response, Taiwan's armed forces monitored the military activities and responded by deploying mission aircraft, naval vessels, and land-based missile systems."
        ]
      },
